TITLE Equilibration 100C Ca solution with calcite/gypsum/aragonite and fixed gas fugacities
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 50 mmol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
    Gypsum 0 0
    Aragonite 0 0
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 25
    CO2(g) 1
    CH4(g) 5
    H2S(g) 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings pe
    10 PUNCH PE
END
